# Fonts. The KOT raster prints from kot_glyph_atlas.ts, a COMMITTED table of
# pre-rendered glyphs; the .ttf files these were built from are dev-time input
# to scripts/build_kot_glyph_atlas.ts and have no business in a runtime image
# (the Dockerfile copies scripts/ for the migration runner). Keeping them out is
# also what makes "the server parses no font" a fact rather than an intention.
scripts/kot_fonts

